class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreams That Fight Back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each forced sleep pulls J-L deeper into a changing dream world, where forgotten voices, buried memories, and the truth behind the Boss begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/a610a1d8a02e4231c2df33ec341ff877.poster.avif?t=1788137173\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/a610a1d8a02e4231c2df33ec341ff877.webm?t=1788137173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/a610a1d8a02e4231c2df33ec341ff877.mp4?t=1788137173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Mastery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels, improve routes, chain kills faster, and push your movement skill further with speedrun-style challenge design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/b63343f9e92f771933fb476bb3432da8.poster.avif?t=1788137173\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/b63343f9e92f771933fb476bb3432da8.webm?t=1788137173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840100/extras/b63343f9e92f771933fb476bb3432da8.mp4?t=1788137173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons are not only for killing. Use them to move faster, create new routes, escape danger, and keep your momentum alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c